Function Items_within_budget(Cost,Priority : Numeric[Items] ; Items :~~
 IndexType ; Budget : Numeric)
Title: Items within Budget
Description: Returns a vector of booleans, indexed by Items, selectin~~
g the top priority items that fit within the given budget.  A smaller~~
 priority value gets higher precedence (i.e., priority 1 is selected ~~
before priority 2).
Definition: index sortedItems := SortIndex(priority);~
var cumCost := cumulate(cost,sortedItems);~
var accept := cumCost<=budget;~
accept[sortedItems=Items]
